R"VG(
# prehistoric6.vg (H-04's second pass): the picture, an event of the people's years painted or cut, read figure by figure
# (`@event ... pre.pic`): what is drawn, a detail the painter added, what the ship takes it for. Each people draws in its own way
# (its colours, its motif, its figures' dress, its mourning: prehistoric.vg's and prehistoric4.vg's pools), so a sentence here is
# almost always one people's.

@root pre.pic.*

genre.picture (words=22..78)
  {pre.pw.wall} {@event flood,famine,sickness,battle,war,sack,coming,stones,founding,winter,drought,death,rulerdeath,omen,contact,exodus,quake,eruption,impact,beasts,storm,fire,wonder,games,fair,pest pre.pic 40} {pre.pw.end}

pre.pw.wall (formula)
  (medium=painted) A picture on the wall, in {pre.paint}.
  (medium=painted) Painted over the older figures, and larger than they are.
  (medium=stone) Cut into the stone, the lines filled with {colour.holy}.
  (medium=painted) On the ceiling of the shelter, where it must have been painted lying down.
  (medium=stone) Pecked into the face of a boulder, the lines worn soft.
  (medium=bone) Cut along a {pre.bone}, very small, a picture.
  (medium=painted) {pre.wall.where}, a picture.

pre.pw.end
  (3)
  (4 contact=1) In a corner, a figure drawn the way the {other} draw them.
  It was painted carefully, every figure finished, the {colour.holy} laid on thick with {pre.brush}.
  It was painted fast; the lines run, and the {colour.holy} has dripped onto the {pre.drip}.
  Later hands have added {pre.added} to it, smaller.
  The {colour.holy} is the earth by {river}, ground and mixed with {pre.binder}.
  {motif.over} run round the edge of it, as round everything the {people} made.
  (medium=painted) {wall.state}
  (medium=stone) {stone.state}
pre.binder (people=1)
  fat
  blood
  egg
  sap of the {tree.n}
  water from {watersrc}
  bone marrow
pre.brush
  a brush of hair
  a chewed stick
  the fingers
  a pad of {material}
pre.drip
  older figures
  floor of the shelter
  {pre.stroke} below
  hands
pre.added
  a {beast}
  their own hands
  a {game.one}
  {tool}
  a row of {pre.stroke}

# ---- the figures, the way each people drew them ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# a figure's dress or mark (each people its own few)
pre.fig.dress (people=3)
  with {motif.over} on its body
  painted {colour.holy} from the waist up
  wrapped in {garment.n:pl}
  with feathers in its hair
  with its hair tied high
  with a {game.one}'s skin over its shoulders
  with its face painted white
  with a string of beads round its neck
  with {tool} in its belt
  with the long arms the {people} gave every figure
# the crowd round it, and what they do
pre.crowd (people=3)
  Many small figures
  The band
  Figures in {colour.mourn}
  Women with their hair cut short
  Children in a row
  Figures with their faces painted
  The hunters, their {pre.weapon} laid down,
pre.crowd.do
  stand round it with their hands on their heads
  stand round it in a circle
  carry {fuel} to a fire beside it
  break {vessel} at its feet
  beat {instrument} beside it
  sit round it with their backs to it
  dance round it, their arms out
  pour {colour.holy} over it from a bowl
  hold up their open hands
  walk away from it in a line

# ---- the kinds --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

pre.pic.battle
  {pre.pb.a} {pre.pb.b} The fight at {$e.place}.
pre.pb.a
  Many figures with {pre.weapon}, facing each other.
  (accent!=black) Two lines of figures, one {colour.holy} and one black, running at each other.
  Figures {pre.fig.dress}, their arms raised, and others falling.
  A crowd of figures round a hill, and a few on top of it with {pre.weapon}.
  Figures with {pre.weapon} coming over {land}, and ours waiting.
pre.pb.b
  Between them, figures lying down; {#$e.value:about} {pre.stroke} beside them.
  Over them all, a black hand.
  ($e.won=1 accent!=black) The {colour.holy} ones stand; the black ones lie down.
  ($e.won=0) Ours are drawn running away, and the painter did not hide it.
  A {bird.one} over the field, and then another, and another.
  At the edge, {pre.crowd.lc} {pre.crowd.do}.
pre.pic.war
  ($e.warkind!=other $e.warkind!=conquest accent!=black) Two groups of figures, one {colour.holy} and one black, with {pre.weapon} raised. The {colour.holy} ones are ours. The quarrel over {$e.place}.
  ($e.warkind=other|$e.warkind=conquest) Two groups of figures, one {colour.holy} and one drawn thin and tall, with {pre.weapon} raised: ours and the {other}.
  Fires drawn on every hill of {land}, and figures running between them with {pre.weapon}: the years of the fighting.
pre.pic.sack
  {houses} drawn burning, and figures running out of them. The {herd} driven off by others. {$e.place}, the night it was taken.
  Figures with {pre.weapon} at the door of {house.one}, and smoke over everything. {$e.place}, taken.
pre.pic.sickness
  {pre.psk.a} {pre.psk.b} {pre.psk.c}
pre.psk.a
  Figures lying down, many, in rows, outside {houses}.
  {house.one} with figures lying outside it.
  Figures carried on poles to {deadplace}, one after another.
  Figures lying down {pre.fig.dress}, more than can be counted.
pre.psk.b
  Over them, red spots.
  A hand held over the mouth of each figure still standing.
  A fire with smoke drawn very thick, as if to drive something off, and {fuel} piled by it.
  {pre.crowd} {pre.crowd.do}.
pre.psk.c
  The sickness at {$e.place}: the {pre.stroke} beside the figures are the dead, {#$e.value:about}.
  {$e.sickness}, the ship thinks, at {$e.place}.
pre.pic.famine
  {pre.pfm.a} {pre.pfm.b} {pre.pfm.c}
pre.pfm.c
  The hunger.
  The hunger, the year the {game} did not come.
  The hungry year at {pre.e.place.or}, when the {vessel} were empty, the ship thinks.
  The hunger, and the {herd} eaten to the last.
pre.pfm.a
  Empty bowls, turned over, beside {houses}.
  A figure with its ribs drawn, holding out {vessel.one}.
  {vessel} drawn open and empty.
  The {herd} drawn as bones.
  Figures digging for roots with {tool}, and finding nothing.
pre.pfm.b
  A {beast}, crossed out.
  Children with their arms out to a figure who has nothing.
  The {crop} drawn without heads.
  {pre.crowd} {pre.crowd.do}.
pre.pic.flood
  {pre.pfl.a} {pre.pfl.b} The flood at {$e.place}.
pre.pfl.a
  Wavy lines over {houses}.
  {river} drawn wide, wider than the {pre.bone.or}.
  Water over {houses}, only their {roofs} showing.
  Wavy lines in {colour.holy} filling the lower half of the {pre.bone.or}.
pre.pfl.b
  Figures on the roofs.
  One figure in the water, its arms up.
  The {herd} swimming, their heads up.
  A boat full of children, and {vessel} floating after it.
pre.pic.drought
  A sun with long rays, many. {watersrc} drawn dry. The {herd} lying down. The years without rain, {#$e.value} of them.
  {pre.sign.sun}, and under it the ground drawn cracked into squares. Figures walking away with empty {vessel}.
pre.pic.quake
  {houses} drawn falling, upside down. A crack across the whole {pre.bone.or}. The ground that moved, at {$e.place}.
  A figure holding up a falling roof, and the ground under it drawn as waves. {$e.place}.
pre.pic.eruption
  A mountain with red at its top, and black lines falling from it like rain. The figures running. {mountain}, angry.
  {mountain} drawn with fire coming out of it, and the {herd} running ahead of the black. {$e.place}.
pre.pic.impact
  A star falling, very large, with a tail of fire. Under it, nothing: the {pre.bone.or} is blackened there.
pre.pic.winter
  A sun drawn small and pale. Snow marks over {houses}. Figures huddled round a fire of {fuel}.
  The {herd} inside {houses} with the people, and the snow drawn up to the {roofs}.
pre.pic.omen
  ($e.omen=comet) A star with a long tail over {mountain}, and figures pointing at it. The hairy star.
  ($e.omen=eclipse) A black sun with a ring of light round it. Figures {pre.fig.dress}, lying flat on the ground.
  ($e.omen!=comet $e.omen!=eclipse) Many small marks in the sky part of the {pre.bone.or}, in {colour.holy}, and figures looking up. A sign over {$e.place}.
  ($e.omen=wanderer 3) A great round light over {mountain}, painted bigger than the sun, and figures turning their faces from it.
  ($e.omen=intruder 3) Two suns over the {herd}, the second painted in {colour.holy}, and figures pointing at it.
  ($e.omen=dance 3) Two suns drawn far apart, the smaller one going over the edge of the wall.
  ($e.omen=bent 3) The stars drawn in a ring round a black place, and the figures under it lying flat.
pre.pic.founding
  {pre.pfo.a} A circle drawn round them: the new place, {$e.place}.
pre.pfo.a
  Figures carrying bundles and a fire in a pot.
  Figures driving the {herd} before them, and one carrying {tool}.
  A figure planting a post, and others watching.
  The first {pre.hut.n} drawn, and figures carrying {material} to it.
pre.hut.n
  (plan=round age<=medieval) round house
  (plan!=round age<=medieval) house
  (age>=industrial) house
  hut
pre.pic.death
  A large figure lying down, with things set round it: {tool}, {vessel.one}, a {beast}. The figure is {$e.a:name}.
  A figure in {colour.mourn}, lying down, and {pre.crowd.lc} {pre.crowd.do}: {$e.a:name}.
pre.crowd.lc
  many small figures
  the band
  figures in {colour.mourn}
  children in a row
pre.pic.rulerdeath
  {pre.prd.a} {pre.crowd} {pre.crowd.do}. {pre.prd.c}
  {pre.prd.a} {pre.prd.b} {pre.prd.c}
pre.prd.a
  A large figure with {pre.crown}, lying down.
  A figure laid on its side with its knees drawn up, {pre.crown.alt}.
  A figure in {colour.mourn}, larger than the rest, its hands crossed on {pre.chest}.
  A figure larger than the rest, laid out flat, its {pre.weapon.one} beside it painted {colour.holy}.
  A tall figure on its back, {pre.fig.dress}.
  A figure {pre.fig.dress} carried on the shoulders of {n} others, {pre.carried}.
  A figure lying on a bed of {pre.bier}, larger than any figure on the {pre.bone.or}, {pre.fig.dress}.
pre.crown (people=2)
  a crown of lines
  horns on its head
  {bird.one} feathers round its head
  a {colour.holy} band round its head
  the {game.one}'s skin over its shoulders
  a ring of {pre.stroke} over its head
pre.crown.alt
  the way the {people} laid their dead
  facing {pre.dead.face}
  with {tool} at its hand
pre.carried
  toward {deadplace}
  its feet first, toward {pre.dead.face}
  out of {$e.place}
  with its {pre.weapon.one} carried behind it
  past {houses}, and everyone outside
pre.bier (people=2)
  branches
  hides
  {tree.n} boughs
  stones
  reeds
pre.weapon.one (people=2)
  spear
  bow
  club
  sling
  axe
pre.prd.b
  A fire beside it, painted very large, and {fuel} heaped by it.
  Its {herd} are drawn walking away, with nobody behind them.
  Its {tool} is drawn broken in two beside it.
  {vessel.one} of {food} is set at its head.
pre.prd.c
  {$e.a:name}, dead.
  It is {$e.a:name}.
  The sign is {$e.a:name}'s.
  {$e.a:name}, who led the band.
  It is {$e.a:name}, who led them {pre.led.how}.
pre.led.how
  over {land}
  to {watersrc} in the dry years
  after the {game}
  (contact=1) against the {other}
  for {#$e.a.reigned|year}
pre.pic.coming
  A long line of figures walking, with the {herd} among them, {pre.whence}. At the front, a figure larger than the rest. The coming into the land.
  Figures with bundles crossing a line that is {pre.whence.line}, and the land on this side drawn empty and full of {game}. The coming.
pre.whence.line
  ($e.whence=sea) the sea
  ($e.whence=river) {river}
  ($e.whence=mountain) {mountain}
  (!has:$e.whence) a river
  ($e.whence!=sea $e.whence!=river $e.whence!=mountain) the edge of the land
pre.pic.stones
  {#number} upright marks in a circle, and figures {pre.fig.dress} dancing round them. The stones.
  Figures pulling a great stone on rollers with ropes, and one standing on it, shouting. The stones raised.
pre.pic.contact
  Figures drawn differently from ours, tall and thin, holding out their hands. Ours hold out theirs, {pre.fig.dress}. The {other}.
  Two groups by a fire, one drawn in {colour.holy}, one in white, passing {trade.thing} between them. The {other}, met.
pre.pic.exodus
  Figures walking away to the edge of the {pre.bone.or}, with their backs turned and {vessel} on their heads. Behind them, an empty circle: {$e.place}.
  The {herd} and the people going over {mountain} in a long line, and {houses} left empty behind them. {$e.place}, left.

# the everyday, drawn
pre.pic.beasts
  ($e.what=great) A {game.one} drawn larger than the shelter, and hunters {pre.fig.dress} small round its feet: the great one, taken at {$e.place}.
  ($e.what=killed) A {game.one} with a figure on its horns, and the other figures running with their {pre.weapon} dropped. The hunt at {$e.place}.
  ($e.what=many) The {game} drawn over and over until they are one shape, the {colour.holy} showing through: the year they came in their thousands.
  ($e.what=none) Hunters with {pre.weapon} in a row facing nothing; the {pre.bone.or} where the {game} should be is bare.
  ($e.what=late|$e.what=early) The {game} coming over the hill with {season.now}'s marks over them; hunters with {pre.weapon} drawn waiting.
pre.pic.storm
  ($e.what=wind) {houses} drawn without their roofs, and lines blown sideways across the {pre.bone.or}. The wind at {$e.place}.
  ($e.what=snow|$e.what=hail) Dots falling thick over {houses} and the {herd}. The storm in {$e.season}.
  ($e.what=dust) The whole {pre.bone.or} smeared brown over the {colour.holy}, and figures with their faces covered. The dust.
  ($e.what=sea|$e.what=rain|$e.what=lightning) A crooked line from the sky to a {tree.n}, and the {tree.n} burning. The storm at {$e.place}.
pre.pic.fire
  Flames drawn as {colour.holy} hands over {houses}, and figures carrying water in {vessel}. The fire at {$e.place}.
  The grass drawn as fire from one end of the {pre.bone.or} to the other, and the {game} running ahead of it.
pre.pic.wonder
  ($e.what=calf) A young beast with two heads, and figures round it with their hands up. At {$e.place}.
  ($e.what=fish) A fish as long as three figures, carried on poles. At {$e.place}.
  ($e.what=stone) A stone falling with lines behind it, and figures running to where it fell.
  ($e.what=beast) A white {game.one}, drawn alone and with great care.
  ($e.what=twins) Two small figures held up together, and a fire of {fuel} drawn very large for them.
  ($e.what!=calf $e.what!=fish $e.what!=stone $e.what!=beast $e.what!=twins) Figures pointing at something the painter did not draw. A wonder at {$e.place}, the ship thinks.
pre.pic.games
  (has:$e.a) Figures running in a line toward a post, one ahead; the one ahead has {$e.a:name}'s sign. The games at {$e.place}.
  Figures {pre.fig.dress} running toward a post, and figures on the bank shouting. The games at {$e.place}.
  (has:$e.a) Two figures locked together, and a ring of figures round them; over the one standing, {$e.a:name}'s sign.
pre.pic.fair
  Many groups of figures round many fires, each group with its own sign: the bands gathered at {$e.place}.
  Figures from two bands, each carrying something, meeting in the middle of the {pre.bone.or}: {trade.thing} for {trade.thing}.
pre.pic.pest
  The {crop} drawn covered in small marks, and figures beating at them with branches. The {pest}, at {$e.place}.
  The {herd} drawn lying down, many, crossed through: the beasts' sickness.
pre.pic.none
  A great herd of {game} and the hunters round it, many, with {pre.weapon}. Under it, hands pressed to the {pre.bone.or} in {colour.holy}, more than can be counted.
  The camp at {$home} drawn from above: {houses}, the fire in the middle, the {herd} in their ring.
  Figures dancing round a fire, with {instrument} drawn larger than any of them.
)VG"
